        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Work out the five-year cost before you compare anything, and establish what the console
            does when you stop paying. The <strong class="text-white">Sole F65</strong> is the
            machine we recommend most often here: you buy it, you own it, and its five-year cost
            is its purchase price.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Want commercial durability with the same independence? The
            <a href="/life-fitness-t3-treadmill/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">Life Fitness T3</a>
            and <a href="/matrix-fitness-t7xe-treadmill/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">Matrix T7xe</a>
            both qualify. Want the classes? Pay for them knowingly — for some people they are the
            difference between training and not.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
